              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say *vātil* — **R4**]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ആറാം",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആറാം (āṟāṁ) — \"sixth\". ആറ് drops its ŭ and takes ആം, with nothing else to notice."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആറാം ദിവസം (āṟāṁ divasam), the sixth day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "That \"nothing else to notice\" is the point of the whole chapter. Six to ten were a separate lesson from one to five when you learned to count, because the words themselves had to be learned. For ordering they are not a separate anything."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "āṟŭ, then āṟāṁ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *āṟŭ*, then *āṟāṁ*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "añcāṁ, āṟāṁ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *añcāṁ, āṟāṁ*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "āṟāṁ divasam — the sixth day",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *āṟāṁ divasam* — the sixth day]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say \"the sixth day\". (ആറാം (āṟāṁ) ദിവസം.) Did the ending change above five? (No.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
