        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ഏഴാം",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഏഴാം (ēḻāṁ) — \"seventh\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഏഴ് carries the curled ḻ, the sound in the name Malayāḷam itself and the one this language shares with Tamil while Kannada and Telugu hardened it away. Adding the ending does not soften it: ഏഴാം, with the tongue still curled back."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഏഴാം ദിവസം (ēḻāṁ divasam), the seventh day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One honest warning about the page. This word begins with ഏ, the independent long ē, and that is a letter this book has taught you to recognise but not yet to write — no stroke order for it has been sourced, so none is offered. Read it; do not copy it yet. That is why this lesson is headed by its romanization rather than by the Malayalam word, the way the counting lessons were."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "ēḻŭ, then ēḻāṁ — keep the ḻ curled both times",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ēḻŭ*, then *ēḻāṁ* — keep the ḻ curled both times]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "āṟāṁ, ēḻāṁ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *āṟāṁ, ēḻāṁ*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "LOOK",
              "instruction": "at ഏഴാം and find the ഴ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU LOOK: at ഏഴാം and find the ഴ]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say \"the seventh day\". (ഏഴാം ദിവസം.) What happens to the ഴ when the ending goes on? (Nothing.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
