              "text": "എട്ട് has a doubled retroflex ṭṭ, written as ട stacked under ട with the virama between them. The ending lands after all of that, so the stack is untouched: എട്ടാം (eṭṭāṁ)."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "എട്ടാം ദിവസം (eṭṭāṁ divasam), the eighth day."
